            "review_text": "mueller_dominic\nCanton of Zurich, Switzerland77 contributions\n0\nExcellent local Vietnamese cuisine\nApr 2025 • Couples\nWe were looking for a restaurant, which offered a selection of banh mi. And we found it and even more ... loving hosts who prepared and lovingly decorated the simple passion fruit drink wonderfully fresh, a fantastic matcha salted cream (attention is addictive to more!), great eggs and spicy chicken banh mi, outstanding vegetarian Bun Cha (mega this tofu) and very tasty spring rolls. You must have visited this place if you were here, otherwise you will miss a culinary attraction!\nTranslated from German\nShow original\nWritten April 23, 2025",
